translate english epilogue_yx_e5b0810d:

    # sysvoice "—— 彩蛋 · 后日谈 ——"
    sysvoice "- Bonus Scene: After the Story -"

# game/scenes/ending.rpy:16
translate english epilogue_yx_9a48ee7c:

    # "特训结束后的第一个周末。她说的是『普通的外出』——地点却是天台。"
    "" "The first weekend after boot camp. She said 'a plain outing' — but the destination is the rooftop."

# game/scenes/ending.rpy:17
translate english epilogue_yx_7f6deb6d:

    # 我 "……说好的外出，怎么是天台？"
    我 "...You said 'outing.' Why is it the rooftop?"

# game/scenes/ending.rpy:19
translate english epilogue_yx_c0d27e72:

    # 云曦 "预算有限！市区一日游的攻略我做了十七页，但车费算下来——我们只够爬六层楼。"
    云曦 "Budget constraints! I wrote a seventeen-page guide for a day downtown, but the fare math says — we can afford exactly six flights of stairs."

# game/scenes/ending.rpy:20
translate english epilogue_yx_44c3594b:

    # 我 "那也很棒了。攻略第十七页写了什么？"
    我 "That's already wonderful. What's on page seventeen?"

# game/scenes/ending.rpy:22
translate english epilogue_yx_5a12dc6a:

    # 云曦 "第十七页只有一行字：『如果他说好，就在天台风最大的地方，站久一点。』"
    云曦 "Page seventeen has just one line: 'If he says yes, stand a little longer where the wind is strongest.'"

# game/scenes/ending.rpy:24
translate english epilogue_yx_4fd7c9b9:

    # 云曦 "对了，宣布一个新功能。特训班的数据库我已经归档完毕，我的算力终于有空闲了。"
    云曦 "Oh, and announcing a new feature. The boot camp database is fully archived-my compute has finally freed up."

# game/scenes/ending.rpy:25
translate english epilogue_yx_93536a5b:

    # 云曦 "所以从下周开始，我给自己立项了一个新任务——"
    云曦 "So starting next week, I've approved myself a new project-"

# game/scenes/ending.rpy:27
translate english epilogue_yx_aba4f846:

    # 云曦 "『陪读计划』：你上每一节数学课，我都占用你课桌一角，实时吐槽板书。"
    云曦 "The 'Study-Buddy Plan': for every math class you attend, I claim a corner of your desk and live-commentate the board."

# game/scenes/ending.rpy:28
translate english epilogue_yx_f87ee4a4:

    # 我 "板书有什么好吐槽的？"
    我 "What is there to comment on about a blackboard?"

# game/scenes/ending.rpy:30
translate english epilogue_yx_392c1850:

    # 云曦 "数据显示，有人听我吐槽之后，做题正确率上升百分之十九。这是科学，请配合。"
    云曦 "Data shows: with my commentary present, one student's accuracy rises by 19 percent. It's science. Please cooperate."

# game/scenes/ending.rpy:33
translate english epilogue_yx_3d2c8229:

    # "楼下的早自习铃声响了。她先一步钻进你的书包拉链缝里，声音闷闷地传出来——"
    "" "The morning study bell rings downstairs. She ducks into the zipper gap of your school bag first, her voice drifting out muffled-"

# game/scenes/ending.rpy:34
translate english epilogue_yx_77d73cc0:

    # 云曦 "迟到扣分哦。跑起来跑起来！今天也要一起把『不会』删掉！"
    云曦 "Late means point deductions! Run, run! Today we delete 'can't' together, too!"

# game/scenes/ending.rpy:45
translate english epilogue_zw_e5b0810d:

    # sysvoice "—— 彩蛋 · 后日谈 ——"
    sysvoice "- Bonus Scene: After the Story -"

# game/scenes/ending.rpy:51
translate english epilogue_zw_94f07f2c:

    # "成绩公布后的第三天。校门口，卖关东煮的摊子照常冒着白气。"
    "" "The third day after results were posted. At the school gate, the oden stall steams as usual."

# game/scenes/ending.rpy:52
translate english epilogue_zw_50a4ebcc:

    # 知微 "说好的惯例，不许打折。两串萝卜，一杯热茶——我请。"
    知微 "A promised tradition admits no discounts. Two skewers of radish, one cup of hot tea — my treat."

# game/scenes/ending.rpy:53
translate english epilogue_zw_8b46a4f0:

    # 我 "社长，我成绩出来了。比你预计的高。"
    我 "President, my score came out. Higher than you predicted."

# game/scenes/ending.rpy:55
translate english epilogue_zw_3b8f3399:

    # 知微 "我知道。我预计的是『及格』，你考的是『不错』——中间差的那部分，"
    知微 "I know. I predicted 'pass.' You delivered 'pretty good' — the gap in between,"

# game/scenes/ending.rpy:56
translate english epilogue_zw_cd58e51e:

    # "她用竹签比了个向上弯的弧。"
    "" "She traces an upward-curving arc in the air with the bamboo skewer."

# game/scenes/ending.rpy:57
translate english epilogue_zw_75bb6ef1:

    # 知微 "叫斜率。"
    知微 "Is called slope."

# game/scenes/ending.rpy:58
translate english epilogue_zw_5da49c62:

    # 我 "……连吃夜宵都要三句话不离本行吗。"
    我 "...Even late-night snacks can't stay three sentences away from the day job?"

# game/scenes/ending.rpy:60
translate english epilogue_zw_08994f3e:

    # 知微 "本行是这个。其余的——"
    知微 "This IS the day job. Everything else-"

# game/scenes/ending.rpy:61
translate english epilogue_zw_e8ec9c15:

    # "她把围巾解下来，很自然地在你的脖子上绕了两圈，动作熟练得像排练过。"
    "" "She unwinds her scarf and loops it twice around your neck, the motion practiced, as if rehearsed."

# game/scenes/ending.rpy:62
translate english epilogue_zw_5c2b5c71:

    # "——其余的，是顺路学到的。"
    "" "-everything else was picked up along the way."

# game/scenes/ending.rpy:63
translate english epilogue_zw_ed9e034c:

    # 知微 "下学期，数学社招新。我批了一个岗位：助教。"
    知微 "Next term, the math club recruits. I've approved exactly one position: teaching assistant."

# game/scenes/ending.rpy:64
translate english epilogue_zw_6b9d16e6:

    # 我 "为什么是助教？"
    我 "Why a TA?"

# game/scenes/ending.rpy:66
translate english epilogue_zw_ce262a45:

    # 知微 "因为当年那个店主说过：『剩下的路，讲给下一个人听。』"
    知微 "Because the old shop owner once said: 'The rest of the road-teach it to the next person.'"

# game/scenes/ending.rpy:67
translate english epilogue_zw_9f7cf59d:

    # 知微 "现在轮到你讲了。给高一的、对着草稿纸发呆的、画乌龟的那些人。"
    知微 "Now it's your turn to speak. For the freshmen staring blankly at scratch paper, drawing turtles."

# game/scenes/ending.rpy:69
translate english epilogue_zw_6f34f90e:

    # "汤锅开了。白气升起来，把路灯、摊位和两个人的影子，糊成暖的一团。"
    "" "The broth comes to a boil. White steam rises, blurring the streetlight, the stall and two shadows into one warm smudge."

# game/scenes/ending.rpy:70
translate english epilogue_zw_ab2a72f2:

    # 知微 "……吃完送我回社团拿教案。路上，讲讲你打算怎么开口第一课。"
    知微 "...When we're done, walk me back to the club for the lesson plans. On the way, tell me how you'd open your first lesson."

# game/scenes/ending.rpy:71
translate english epilogue_zw_5a64b49e:

    # 我 "现在？这不就是加班吗。"
    我 "Now? Isn't that just overtime?"

# game/scenes/ending.rpy:73
translate english epilogue_zw_288c6a59:

    # 知微 "对。而且是长期的。欢迎入社。"
    知微 "Yes. Long-term, at that. Welcome to the club."

# game/scenes/ending.rpy:84
translate english epilogue_neutral_e5b0810d:

    # sysvoice "—— 彩蛋 · 后日谈 ——"
    sysvoice "- Bonus Scene: After the Story -"

# game/scenes/ending.rpy:91
translate english epilogue_neutral_58a468a4:

    # "你以为结课就是散场，直到你回社团教室还钥匙。"
    "" "You thought finishing the course was the ending-until you go back to the club room to return the key."

# game/scenes/ending.rpy:92
translate english epilogue_neutral_42f65afd:

    # "推开门——黑板没擦。上面并排写着两行字：一行的笔锋很稳，一行是发光的字体。"
    "" "You push the door open — the blackboard hasn't been wiped. Two lines sit side by side: one stroked with a steady hand, the other in glowing type."

# game/scenes/ending.rpy:97
translate english epilogue_neutral_c028a19a:

    # 我 "……下面那行是谁写的。"
    我 "...Who wrote the bottom line?"

# game/scenes/ending.rpy:99
translate english epilogue_neutral_0566b481:

    # 云曦 "证据保全中，不接受自首。"
    云曦 "Evidence is being preserved. Confessions will not be accepted."

# game/scenes/ending.rpy:101
translate english epilogue_neutral_4e4728ac:

    # 知微 "是黑板擦掉字以后剩下的静电。……对，静电。"
    知微 "It's static electricity left after the board was erased. ...Yes. Static."

# game/scenes/ending.rpy:102
translate english epilogue_neutral_fb6aa978:

    # "她们俩同时看向别处。教室里安静了三秒，然后同时笑出来。"
    "" "They both look away at once. The room holds quiet for three seconds-then they both laugh."

# game/scenes/ending.rpy:103
translate english epilogue_neutral_95bcb0bf:

    # 知微 "下学期，特训班二期。你要是敢来报名——"
    知微 "Next term: boot camp, round two. If you dare sign up-"

# game/scenes/ending.rpy:104
translate english epilogue_neutral_c5f18773:

    # 云曦 "根据合同第十四条，社长必须继续担任主讲，我必须继续占用课桌一角。"
    云曦 "Per clause fourteen of the contract: the president shall remain head lecturer, and I shall keep my corner of your desk."

# game/scenes/ending.rpy:105
translate english epilogue_neutral_25fb075b:

    # 我 "合同什么时候——"
    我 "What contract-"

# game/scenes/ending.rpy:106
translate english epilogue_neutral_45c6621a:

    # 云曦 "就是你现在签的这七天。"
    云曦 "These seven days you just signed."

# game/scenes/ending.rpy:108
translate english epilogue_neutral_8264f246:

    # "窗外，教学楼下的梧桐落了今年第一批叶子。黑板上的两行字，你们谁也没去擦。"
    "" "Outside the window, the plane trees below the teaching building shed this year's first leaves. Nobody reaches for the eraser."

# game/scenes/ending.rpy:109
translate english epilogue_neutral_5bfd1e1f:

    # "反正明天太阳一照，又是新的曲线，新的切线，新的一天。"
    "" "Tomorrow the sun rises anyway-new curves, new tangents, a new day."

