# game/scenes/ending.rpy:50
translate english epilogue_yx_599c8c37:

    # "跑出几步，书包里的蓝光忽然安静了一瞬，然后很小声地说——"
    "" "A few steps out, the blue light in your bag goes still for a moment, then says, very quietly-"

# game/scenes/ending.rpy:51
translate english epilogue_yx_7490cc91:

    # 云曦 "……三天后傍晚，教学楼顶层。那个「签名」，好像真的在等我们。这次，我陪你把它算出来。"
    云曦 "...Three days from now, at dusk, top floor. That 'signature' really seems to be waiting for us. This time, I'll solve it with you."

# game/scenes/ending.rpy:92
translate english epilogue_zw_1aac9fa8:

    # "走到路口，她忽然停了一下，手按在包里那封火漆信上。"
    "" "At the corner she suddenly stops, her hand resting on the wax-sealed letter in her bag."

# game/scenes/ending.rpy:93
translate english epilogue_zw_23b5178e:

    # 知微 "三天后，教学楼顶层。前代社长在信里只写了一句『第二段故事在暑假』……"
    知微 "Three days from now, top floor. The previous president wrote only one line in that letter: 'The second part of the story lives in summer'..."

# game/scenes/ending.rpy:95
translate english epilogue_zw_5c1e93bc:

    # 知微 "我要去赴这个约。——你负责把导数，练到能在梦里解题。"
    知微 "I'm going to keep that appointment. Your job is to practice derivatives until you can solve them in your dreams."

# game/scenes/ending.rpy:133
translate english epilogue_neutral_13f0fa73:

    # "锁门前，云曦盯着通知栏里那条已经消失的陌生日志，轻声说——"
    "" "Before the lock-up, Yunxi stares at the vanished unknown log in the notification bar and says softly-"

