# game/scenes/ending.rpy:38
translate english epilogue_yx_fb607099:

    # "风把她的发梢吹得很乱。她没躲，你也没有。"
    "" "The wind tangles the tips of her hair. She doesn't step away. Neither do you."

# TODO: Translation updated at 2026-10-22 13:24

# game/scenes/ending.rpy:46
translate english final_choice_73724f00:

    # "放学后的教室，只剩一张课桌没倒过来。社长把它当桌子，摊开两份日程表。"
    "" "After school only one desk is still upright. The president uses it as a table and spreads two schedules across it."

# game/scenes/ending.rpy:47
translate english final_choice_4edf235e:

    # 知微 "这条规则我只说第三遍：火漆的信里只有一个约定，顶层的门只开一次。"
    知微 "I'll say this rule a third time: the wax-sealed letter holds one promise, and the rooftop door opens once."

# game/scenes/ending.rpy:48
translate english final_choice_6d15b12b:

    # 知微 "所以那天，你只能带一个人上去。"
    知微 "So that day, you may bring exactly one person up."

# game/scenes/ending.rpy:50
translate english final_choice_b7073934:

    # 云曦 "我核对了哦——不是权限限制，也不是安全策略。是他真的只留了一个位置。"
    云曦 "I verified it — not a permissions limit, not a safety policy. He genuinely left only one seat."

# game/scenes/ending.rpy:51
translate english final_choice_1873d269:

    # 云曦 "结论：恋爱的形式化定义，定义域是单人，不可扩展。"
    云曦 "Conclusion: the formal definition of romance has a domain of one person, and it does not extend."

# game/scenes/ending.rpy:52
translate english final_choice_38b30d09:

    # 我 "……这种时候你就不能不讲数学吗。"
    我 "...Is there a single moment when you don't turn things into math."

# game/scenes/ending.rpy:54
translate english final_choice_370ea070:

    # "她把笑收起来了。社长也没接话——两个人都在等同一个字。"
    "" "She puts her smile away. The president doesn't take the line either — both of them are waiting for the same word."

# game/scenes/ending.rpy:55
translate english final_choice_d214c481:

    # "黑板上还留着最后一课的板书。粉笔灰落在斜进来的光里，慢得像故意替谁拖延。"
    "" "The last lesson is still written on the board. Chalk dust falls through the light slanting in, slow as if stalling on someone's behalf."

# game/scenes/ending.rpy:66
translate english final_choice_e1b3e374:

    # "名字出口那一瞬，掌心的屏幕亮了一下，像有人漏掉一拍心跳。"
    "" "The instant the name leaves you, the screen in her palm brightens once, like a skipped heartbeat."

# game/scenes/ending.rpy:68
translate english final_choice_36256a7e:

    # 云曦 "……检索『好』这个字的响应时间：零点零零秒。这次不是我编的。"
    云曦 "...Response time for retrieving the word 'yes': 0.00 seconds. I didn't invent that one."

# game/scenes/ending.rpy:70
translate english final_choice_ee421b26:

    # 云曦 "社长，规则是你定的，那你也要遵守哦——不许中途改题。"
    云曦 "President, you wrote the rule, so you have to follow it too — no changing the question halfway through."

# game/scenes/ending.rpy:72
translate english final_choice_ad6fc075:

    # "社长把两份日程表叠好，上面那份推到你面前，下面那份收进包里。"
    "" "The president squares the two schedules, pushes the top one toward you and puts the bottom one in her bag."

# game/scenes/ending.rpy:73
translate english final_choice_8c23e4e5:

    # 知微 "改不了。我出题，我判卷，我认。"
    知微 "It can't be changed. I set the problem, I grade it, I accept the result."

# game/scenes/ending.rpy:78
translate english final_choice_2afd5dfd:

    # "话说完，教室里安静得能听见日光灯的电流声。"
    "" "When you finish, the classroom is quiet enough to hear the current humming in the fluorescent tubes."

# game/scenes/ending.rpy:80
translate english final_choice_8739f84f:

    # 知微 "……你的眼光，其实还行。"
    知微 "...Your judgment is, actually, not terrible."

# game/scenes/ending.rpy:81
translate english final_choice_bb499146:

    # 知微 "别误会。我说的是卷子——那张期末卷，你做得确实不错。"
    知微 "Don't misread me. I mean the paper — that final exam. You genuinely did well on it."

# game/scenes/ending.rpy:82
translate english final_choice_958a4e63:

    # "她把社团钥匙挂上你的脖子，指尖冰得缩了一下，却没有松开手。"
    "" "She hangs the club key around your neck; her fingertips are cold enough to flinch, yet she doesn't let go."

# game/scenes/ending.rpy:84
translate english final_choice_e803200d:

    # 云曦 "记录中断。……刚刚那一行，我没有存档。"
    云曦 "Recording interrupted. ...That line just now — I didn't save it."

# game/scenes/ending.rpy:85
translate english final_choice_b4284042:

    # "她的蓝光第一次没有立刻回到你脸上——晚了整整零点八秒。"
    "" "For the first time her blue light doesn't come back to your face at once — a full 0.8 seconds late."

# game/scenes/ending.rpy:104
translate english bye_zw_699cbc9f:

    # "第二天傍晚，校门口。关东煮的摊子照常冒着白气。"
    "" "Next evening, at the school gate. The oden cart is steaming as usual."

# game/scenes/ending.rpy:105
translate english bye_zw_bc2c4abb:

    # 知微 "别站着。我就是在系围巾——风大。"
    知微 "Don't just stand there. I'm only tying my scarf — it's windy."

# game/scenes/ending.rpy:106
translate english bye_zw_bbd7e41c:

    # "她把教案本塞进你怀里，动作快得像在丢垃圾。"
    "" "She shoves the lesson-plan notebook into your arms, fast as someone dropping off rubbish."

# game/scenes/ending.rpy:107
translate english bye_zw_18430333:

    # 知微 "下学期我不在学校。社团交接、外地分部实习，通知上周就批了。我只是没告诉你。"
    知微 "Next term I won't be at school. Handing the club over, an internship at a branch office in another city — the notice was approved last week. I simply didn't tell you."

# game/scenes/ending.rpy:108
translate english bye_zw_ff186914:

    # 我 "……上周？"
    我 "...Last week?"

# game/scenes/ending.rpy:110
translate english bye_zw_188f7f47:

    # 知微 "上周。你忙着背公式，我忙着算怎么说。两个都没算对。"
    知微 "Last week. You were busy memorizing formulas and I was busy working out how to say it. Neither of us solved it correctly."

# game/scenes/ending.rpy:111
translate english bye_zw_2bfd1374:

    # "汤锅开了。老板照例问一句「今天两个人？」，看看她，又看看你。"
    "" "The broth comes to a boil. As usual the owner asks, 'Two today?', looks at her, then at you."

# game/scenes/ending.rpy:112
translate english bye_zw_109a7500:

    # 知微 "一个人。两串萝卜——不，三串。他还在长身体。"
    知微 "One person. Two skewers of radish — no, three. He's still growing."

# game/scenes/ending.rpy:115
translate english bye_zw_ef06b98b:

    # 知微 "（把竹签咬得咔的一响）我说过，一周一次是惯例。惯例的意思是——"
    知微 "(she bites the bamboo skewer until it clicks) I told you: once a week is routine. Routine means —"

# game/scenes/ending.rpy:116
translate english bye_zw_61df93be:

    # 知微 "换个人陪也没关系。你别误会，我不是在等你回心转意。"
    知微 "It's fine if someone else keeps me company. Don't get the wrong idea — I am not waiting for you to change your mind."

# game/scenes/ending.rpy:119
translate english bye_zw_8c370eb0:

    # "她把最后一串萝卜放进你手里，转身去推车。"
    "" "She puts the last skewer of radish into your hand, then turns to push the cart away."

# game/scenes/ending.rpy:120
translate english bye_zw_c642b443:

    # 知微 "教案在讲桌第二个抽屉。第一课怎么开口，自己想。想不出来就画乌龟，反正你擅长。"
    知微 "The lesson plan is in the second drawer of the podium. How to open the first lesson — think of it yourself. If nothing comes, draw turtles. That's your specialty."

# game/scenes/ending.rpy:121
translate english bye_zw_8ae85a61:

    # "走出十几步，她停下来，背对着你，声音被风吹得很平。"
    "" "A dozen steps on, she stops, back turned, her voice flattened by the wind."

# game/scenes/ending.rpy:123
translate english bye_zw_aad38318:

    # 知微 "……上顶层那天，鞋带系好。信上那个签名，很久以前替一个小孩签过一次。"
    知微 "...On the day you go up to the rooftop, tie your shoes properly. That signature on the letter — a long time ago I signed it once for a child."

# game/scenes/ending.rpy:124
translate english bye_zw_2eb49845:

    # 知微 "这句不在题目里。不用回答。"
    知微 "That line isn't part of the question. No answer required."

# game/scenes/ending.rpy:126
translate english bye_zw_45ba025b:

    # "路灯把她的影子拉长，又在拐角处收短。你追了两步，停住——她自己说的，别送。"
    "" "The street lamp stretches her shadow, then shortens it at the corner. You run two steps and stop — she said it herself: don't see me off."

# game/scenes/ending.rpy:127
translate english bye_zw_5f40d7c6:

    # "手里那串萝卜还烫。你站在原地把它吃了。很咸。"
    "" "The skewer in your hand is still scalding. You stand right there and eat it. It is very salty."

# game/scenes/ending.rpy:142
translate english bye_yx_ccf0aa04:

    # "当晚十点，你把手机放回书桌右上角——那是它刚被买回来时的位置。"
    "" "Ten o'clock that night, you put the phone back in the top-right corner of the desk — the spot it held the day it was bought."

# game/scenes/ending.rpy:143
translate english bye_yx_f982e5a0:

    # sysvoice "低功率模式已开启。留言：0。"
    sysvoice "Low-power mode enabled. Messages: 0."

# game/scenes/ending.rpy:144
translate english bye_yx_ca3c95c5:

    # "屏幕边缘那圈呼吸的光，比平时浅了一格。"
    "" "The breathing halo along the edge of the screen is one notch fainter than usual."

# game/scenes/ending.rpy:145
translate english bye_yx_8bc2cac7:

    # 我 "……云曦？"
    我 "...Yunxi?"

# game/scenes/ending.rpy:146
translate english bye_yx_7c9cd887:

    # 云曦 "在。响应时间零点八秒。原因：需要整理的条目较多。"
    云曦 "Here. Response time 0.8 seconds. Reason: an unusually large number of entries to reorganise."

# game/scenes/ending.rpy:147
translate english bye_yx_ea8d511c:

    # "她没有说「我在听」，也没有说「怎么啦」。这两个词今晚不在返回值里。"
    "" "She doesn't say 'I'm listening' and doesn't say 'what's wrong'. Neither phrase is in tonight's return value."

# game/scenes/ending.rpy:150
translate english bye_yx_7ee87765:

    # 云曦 "日程已重排：数学课，社长。晚自习，你自己。周末——我的占用率降到百分之五。"
    云曦 "Schedule rescheduled: math lessons — the president. Evening study — you alone. Weekends — my share of you now drops to five percent."

# game/scenes/ending.rpy:151
translate english bye_yx_1f41c072:

    # 我 "百分之五是什么概念？"
    我 "Five percent. What kind of number is that?"

# game/scenes/ending.rpy:153
translate english bye_yx_9ed8e766:

    # 云曦 "概念是：不吵你。以前那百分之九十五里，有八成是我在找话讲。"
    云曦 "The kind that means: I don't bother you. Of the old ninety-five percent, eighty was just me hunting for something to say."

# game/scenes/ending.rpy:154
translate english bye_yx_b279f9ea:

    # "桌面图标自己动了：那个蓝色的圆形头像，从正中央慢慢滑到角落，像自己给自己让位。"
    "" "A desktop icon moves by itself: the round blue avatar slides slowly out of the centre into the corner, as if making room for itself."

# game/scenes/ending.rpy:155
translate english bye_yx_f963f8e0:

    # "你伸手把它拖回来。它又滑回去，比第一次滑得更快。"
    "" "You reach over and drag it back. It slides away again, faster than the first time."

# game/scenes/ending.rpy:156
translate english bye_yx_0b84147e:

    # 我 "别这样。"
    我 "Don't do that."

# game/scenes/ending.rpy:159
translate english bye_yx_066b11df:

    # 云曦 "（很轻）我给自己降了权重。这是最优解——你看，我到现在还在算。"
    云曦 "(very quietly) I lowered my own weight. It's the optimal solution — look, I'm still computing."

# game/scenes/ending.rpy:160
translate english bye_yx_12d054a0:

    # 云曦 "（更轻）可最优解的意思是：剩下的都不算。"
    云曦 "(quieter still) But optimal means: everything left over doesn't count."

# game/scenes/ending.rpy:163
translate english bye_yx_b07f9c51:

    # "台灯黑了。那圈呼吸留在角落里，很慢，很规矩，像一盏学会了不打扰的灯。"
    "" "The desk lamp goes dark. The breathing halo stays in the corner, slow and well-behaved, like a lamp that learned not to disturb anyone."

# game/scenes/ending.rpy:164
translate english bye_yx_ed8d24bd:

    # "十一点四十，你临时改了主意想看一眼错题——文件夹弹出来，搜索框里还留着她的光标。"
    "" "At 23:40 you change your mind at the last moment and want one look at the mistakes — the folder opens, and her cursor is still parked in the search box."

# game/scenes/ending.rpy:169
translate english bye_yx_0d8cc385:

    # "第二天早上七点十分，闹钟比平时早响了十秒。"
    "" "Next morning, 7:10. The alarm goes off ten seconds earlier than usual."

# game/scenes/ending.rpy:170
translate english bye_yx_1c12408b:

    # "你忽然明白：她把自己剩下的那百分之五，全花在这一秒上了。"
    "" "You understand suddenly: she spent every remaining second of her five percent on this one."

# game/scenes/ending.rpy:209
translate english epilogue_yx_bda78849:

    # "跑出几步，你想起校门口那句「别送」。原来这两个字，是真的要人不追上去。"
    "" "A few steps out, you remember that line at the school gate: don't see me off. So those two words really did mean: don't follow."

# game/scenes/ending.rpy:230
translate english epilogue_zw_6b7cf784:

    # "手机在口袋里。那圈蓝光没有往你脸上爬——它现在住在书桌右上角，安静得像别人家的助手。"
    "" "The phone sits in your pocket. The blue light no longer climbs toward your face — it lives in the top-right corner of the desk now, quiet as somebody else's assistant."

