# game/scenes/ending.rpy:308
translate english epilogue_neutral_67bbeea9:

    # 云曦 "三天后傍晚，顶层。……他好像有句憋了很久的话要说。放心，这次不是系统故障，是我自己按下的「同意」。"
    云曦 "Three days from now, at dusk, top floor.... He seems to have something to say, held back for a long time. Don't worry-this time it isn't a system glitch. I pressed 'consent' myself."

